      "end_ms": 727280,
      "text": "然后那个包括那开超市"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 266,
      "start_ms": 727280,
      "end_ms": 729200,
      "text": "开便利店批发部这种事情呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 267,
      "start_ms": 729200,
      "end_ms": 730400,
      "text": "我们也很鼓励"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 268,
      "start_ms": 730400,
      "end_ms": 733080,
      "text": "因为这个还有一个开超市这个事情"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 269,
      "start_ms": 733080,
      "end_ms": 735750,
      "text": "还有一个就是弱势群体"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 270,
      "start_ms": 735750,
      "end_ms": 737810,
      "text": "你要和和社区去联系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 271,
      "start_ms": 737810,
      "end_ms": 739770,
      "text": "平时可以帮他弱弱势群体"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 272,
      "start_ms": 739770,
      "end_ms": 740870,
      "text": "就老头老太太"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 273,
      "start_ms": 740870,
      "end_ms": 741950,
      "text": "她个米搬不上去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 274,
      "start_ms": 741950,
      "end_ms": 742870,
      "text": "帮忙搬一下啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 275,
      "start_ms": 742870,
      "end_ms": 747760,
      "text": "这个就是那么这个东西是可有可无道德层面的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 276,
      "start_ms": 747760,
      "end_ms": 748560,
      "text": "随便你坐不住了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 277,
      "start_ms": 748560,
      "end_ms": 750080,
      "text": "我才一本啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 278,
      "start_ms": 750080,
      "end_ms": 754480,
      "text": "我不强求我不强求我不强求好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 279,
      "start_ms": 754870,
      "end_ms": 756470,
      "text": "那我们就讲到这边啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 280,
      "start_ms": 756470,
      "end_ms": 758710,
      "text": "就是这个长征路上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 281,
      "start_ms": 758710,
      "end_ms": 760550,
      "text": "就是这就是历史的辩证法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 282,
      "start_ms": 761550,
      "end_ms": 763579,
      "text": "历史的辩证法就在于此"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 283,
      "start_ms": 763579,
      "end_ms": 765299,
      "text": "很垃圾的一个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 284,
      "start_ms": 765299,
      "end_ms": 767849,
      "text": "但是在真正牛逼的人眼里"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 285,
      "start_ms": 767849,
      "end_ms": 769449,
      "text": "他就是牛逼的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 286,
      "start_ms": 769449,
      "end_ms": 770689,
      "text": "在垃圾的人眼里"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 287,
      "start_ms": 770689,
      "end_ms": 772389,
      "text": "垃圾的东西他就把他当垃圾"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 288,
      "start_ms": 772389,
      "end_ms": 774049,
      "text": "用他那个垃圾腔调"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 289,
      "start_ms": 774049,
      "end_ms": 775329,
      "text": "垃圾口吻继续说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 290,
      "start_ms": 775329,
      "end_ms": 776339,
      "text": "这是个垃圾事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 291,
      "start_ms": 776339,
      "end_ms": 779050,
      "text": "垃圾只能看着垃圾啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 292,
      "start_ms": 779050,
      "end_ms": 780950,
      "text": "那么像我们这种惯鱼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 293,
      "start_ms": 780950,
      "end_ms": 782890,
      "text": "我眼睛珠子就是金子做的人啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 294,
      "start_ms": 782890,
      "end_ms": 785519,
      "text": "垃圾也闪闪出金光来了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 295,
      "start_ms": 785519,
      "end_ms": 787379,
      "text": "那么我们是捡到大便宜了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 296,
      "start_ms": 787379,
      "end_ms": 787959,
      "text": "感谢啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 297,
      "start_ms": 787959,
      "end_ms": 789179,
      "text": "thanks thanks啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 298,
      "start_ms": 789179,
      "end_ms": 791460,
      "text": "这个东西被骂骂他干嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 299,
      "start_ms": 793060,
      "end_ms": 793800,
      "text": "别骂他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 300,
      "start_ms": 793800,
      "end_ms": 795220,
      "text": "他开了活动空间啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 301,
      "start_ms": 795220,
      "end_ms": 796160,
      "text": "挺好的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 302,
      "start_ms": 796160,
      "end_ms": 799280,
      "text": "意识形态口子开着活动空间那行啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 303,
      "start_ms": 799280,
      "end_ms": 801200,
      "text": "那我们以后就所有我们做这事情"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 304,
      "start_ms": 801200,
      "end_ms": 803390,
      "text": "都说我们是在长征路上开超市"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 305,
      "start_ms": 803390,
      "end_ms": 804310,
      "text": "非常好呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 306,
      "start_ms": 804310,
      "end_ms": 805130,
      "text": "开超市呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 307,
      "start_ms": 805130,
      "end_ms": 807390,
      "text": "人家第三世界国家那反抗力量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 308,
      "start_ms": 811610,
      "end_ms": 814730,
      "text": "啊这他们是走走在长征路上呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 309,
      "start_ms": 814730,
      "end_ms": 815890,
      "text": "在反抗帝国主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 310,
      "start_ms": 815890,
      "end_ms": 817160,
      "text": "美帝国主义啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 311,
      "start_ms": 817160,
      "end_ms": 819880,
      "text": "这个西方殖民势力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 312,
      "start_ms": 819880,
      "end_ms": 821760,
      "text": "我们就给他开超市"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 313,
      "start_ms": 821760,
      "end_ms": 822440,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 314,
      "start_ms": 822440,
      "end_ms": 824520,
      "text": "你这个意识形态作品都说了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 315,
      "start_ms": 824520,
      "end_ms": 825080,
      "text": "这个开超时"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 316,
      "start_ms": 825080,
      "end_ms": 826120,
      "text": "这是带队的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 317,
      "start_ms": 826120,
      "end_ms": 828800,
      "text": "那不是恨不能穿越穿越时空啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 318,
      "start_ms": 828800,
      "end_ms": 830770,
      "text": "回溯回溯仙人一样"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 319,
      "start_ms": 830770,
      "end_ms": 832050,
      "text": "穿越时空去开超市"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 320,
      "start_ms": 833090,
      "end_ms": 835190,
      "text": "我他妈在同一个时间啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 321,
      "start_ms": 835190,
      "end_ms": 837329,
      "text": "历史当中我可以开超时"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 322,
      "start_ms": 837329,
      "end_ms": 839589,
      "text": "所以赶紧不要骂这个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 323,
      "start_ms": 839589,
      "end_ms": 842509,
      "text": "要纵容这种意识形态大规模传播"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 324,
      "start_ms": 842509,
      "end_ms": 844500,
      "text": "变成一种政治正确"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 325,
      "start_ms": 844500,
      "end_ms": 846980,
      "text": "我们才有活动空间的保障"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 326,
      "start_ms": 846980,
      "end_ms": 849060,
      "text": "哼谁他妈骂这个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 327,
      "start_ms": 849060,
      "end_ms": 849820,
      "text": "谁就是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 328,
      "start_ms": 849820,
      "end_ms": 852520,
      "text": "根本没在实践懂吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 329,
      "start_ms": 852520,
      "end_ms": 856800,
      "text": "台面上那些嘴巴左人他妈的巴子骂这个东西的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 330,
      "start_ms": 856800,
      "end_ms": 859810,
      "text": "全是不想做任何事情的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 331,
      "start_ms": 860010,
      "end_ms": 862610,
      "text": "哪怕他自己都没有团团伙伙去开超市"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 332,
      "start_ms": 862610,
      "end_ms": 863250,
      "text": "开批发部"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 333,
      "start_ms": 863250,
      "end_ms": 865870,
      "text": "他都没这个本事的废物"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 334,
      "start_ms": 866150,
      "end_ms": 867690,
      "text": "废物中的废物"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 335,
      "start_ms": 867690,
      "end_ms": 868570,
      "text": "你妈的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 336,
      "start_ms": 868570,
      "end_ms": 872280,
      "text": "考虑到他现在就是个他们啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 337,
      "start_ms": 872280,
      "end_ms": 874460,
      "text": "考虑到他我不是针对特殊个人啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 338,
      "start_ms": 874460,
      "end_ms": 877480,
      "text": "考虑到这群人往往就是现实当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 339,
      "start_ms": 877480,
      "end_ms": 878620,
      "text": "一点力量都没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 340,
      "start_ms": 878620,
      "end_ms": 881370,
      "text": "手上连超市都没有啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 341,
      "start_ms": 881370,
      "end_ms": 882210,
      "text": "兔子都没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 342,
      "start_ms": 882210,
      "end_ms": 883230,
      "text": "什么都没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 343,
      "start_ms": 883230,
      "end_ms": 884230,
      "text": "屁都没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 344,
      "start_ms": 885230,
      "end_ms": 886530,
      "text": "我就原谅他们吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 345,
      "start_ms": 886530,
      "end_ms": 888270,
      "text": "好吧就讲到这边"
    }
